<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1200" height="640" viewBox="0 0 1200 640" role="img"><rect width="1200" height="640" fill="#0e1015"/><text x="46.0" y="52.0" font-family="'Inter Tight','IBM Plex Sans','Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif" font-size="23.8" font-weight="700" fill="#ecebe7" text-anchor="start" >Where the camera stands decides who has the power</text><text x="46.0" y="78.0" font-family="'Inter Tight','IBM Plex Sans','Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif" font-size="18.5" font-weight="450" fill="#9aa0ab" text-anchor="start" >Side view: the same subject from five heights, and what each one tells the viewer</text><line x1="40" y1="560" x2="960" y2="560" stroke="#262a35" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M 779.5 310.4 Q 779.5 298.9 807.2 298.9 L 832.8 298.9 Q 860.5 298.9 860.5 310.4 L 862.7 393.6 L 854.3 410.7 L 841.3 560.0 L 825.1 560.0 L 820.0 427.7 L 814.9 560.0 L 798.7 560.0 L 785.7 410.7 L 777.3 393.6 Z" fill="#343a48" stroke-linejoin="round"/><rect x="811.5" y="274.1" width="17.1" height="29.9" fill="#343a48"/><ellipse cx="820.0" cy="261.3" rx="17.9" ry="22.2" fill="#343a48"/><line x1="700.0" y1="118.0" x2="820.0" y2="261.3" stroke="#e0a458" stroke-opacity=".55" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-dasharray="5 5"/><g transform="translate(700.0 118.0) rotate(50.1) scale(1.0)"><rect x="-24" y="-14" width="32" height="28" rx="5" fill="#d9dce2"/><circle cx="-15" cy="-19" r="6" fill="none" stroke="#d9dce2" stroke-width="3"/><circle cx="-1" cy="-19" r="6" fill="none" stroke="#d9dce2" stroke-width="3"/><polygon points="8,-7 24,-13 24,13 8,7" fill="#8e97a8"/></g><text x="742.0" y="112.0" font-family="'Inter Tight','IBM Plex Sans','Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif" font-size="21.1" font-weight="700" fill="#ecebe7" text-anchor="start" >Overhead</text><text x="742.0" y="132.0" font-family="'Inter Tight','IBM Plex Sans','Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif" font-size="17.8" font-weight="450" fill="#9aa0ab" text-anchor="start" >trapped, watched from above</text><line x1="430.0" y1="175.0" x2="820.0" y2="261.3" stroke="#e0a458" stroke-opacity=".55" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-dasharray="5 5"/><g transform="translate(430.0 175.0) rotate(12.5) scale(1.0)"><rect x="-24" y="-14" width="32" height="28" rx="5" fill="#d9dce2"/><circle cx="-15" cy="-19" r="6" fill="none" stroke="#d9dce2" stroke-width="3"/><circle cx="-1" cy="-19" r="6" fill="none" stroke="#d9dce2" stroke-width="3"/><polygon points="8,-7 24,-13 24,13 8,7" fill="#8e97a8"/></g><text x="250.0" y="170.0" font-family="'Inter Tight','IBM Plex Sans','Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif" font-size="21.1" font-weight="700" fill="#ecebe7" text-anchor="start" >High angle</text><text x="250.0" y="190.0" font-family="'Inter Tight','IBM Plex Sans','Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif" font-size="17.8" font-weight="450" fill="#9aa0ab" text-anchor="start" >small, powerless, exposed</text><line x1="380.0" y1="261.3" x2="820.0" y2="261.3" stroke="#e0a458" stroke-opacity=".55" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-dasharray="5 5"/><g transform="translate(380.0 261.3) rotate(0.0) scale(1.0)"><rect x="-24" y="-14" width="32" height="28" rx="5" fill="#d9dce2"/><circle cx="-15" cy="-19" r="6" fill="none" stroke="#d9dce2" stroke-width="3"/><circle cx="-1" cy="-19" r="6" fill="none" stroke="#d9dce2" stroke-width="3"/><polygon points="8,-7 24,-13 24,13 8,7" fill="#8e97a8"/></g><text x="150.0" y="257.3" font-family="'Inter Tight','IBM Plex Sans','Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif" font-size="21.1" font-weight="700" fill="#ecebe7" text-anchor="start" >Eye level</text><text x="150.0" y="277.3" font-family="'Inter Tight','IBM Plex Sans','Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif" font-size="17.8" font-weight="450" fill="#9aa0ab" text-anchor="start" >neutral: we stand with them</text><line x1="430.0" y1="470.0" x2="820.0" y2="261.3" stroke="#e0a458" stroke-opacity=".55" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-dasharray="5 5"/><g transform="translate(430.0 470.0) rotate(-28.1) scale(1.0)"><rect x="-24" y="-14" width="32" height="28" rx="5" fill="#d9dce2"/><circle cx="-15" cy="-19" r="6" fill="none" stroke="#d9dce2" stroke-width="3"/><circle cx="-1" cy="-19" r="6" fill="none" stroke="#d9dce2" stroke-width="3"/><polygon points="8,-7 24,-13 24,13 8,7" fill="#8e97a8"/></g><text x="190.0" y="468.0" font-family="'Inter Tight','IBM Plex Sans','Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif" font-size="21.1" font-weight="700" fill="#ecebe7" text-anchor="start" >Low angle</text><text x="190.0" y="488.0" font-family="'Inter Tight','IBM Plex Sans','Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif" font-size="17.8" font-weight="450" fill="#9aa0ab" text-anchor="start" >looming, a threat, in control</text><line x1="560.0" y1="545.0" x2="820.0" y2="361.6" stroke="#e0a458" stroke-opacity=".55" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-dasharray="5 5"/><g transform="translate(560.0 545.0) rotate(-35.2) scale(1.0)"><rect x="-24" y="-14" width="32" height="28" rx="5" fill="#d9dce2"/><circle cx="-15" cy="-19" r="6" fill="none" stroke="#d9dce2" stroke-width="3"/><circle cx="-1" cy="-19" r="6" fill="none" stroke="#d9dce2" stroke-width="3"/><polygon points="8,-7 24,-13 24,13 8,7" fill="#8e97a8"/></g><text x="600.0" y="600.0" font-family="'Inter Tight','IBM Plex Sans','Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif" font-size="21.1" font-weight="700" fill="#ecebe7" text-anchor="start" >Ground level</text><text x="600.0" y="620.0" font-family="'Inter Tight','IBM Plex Sans','Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif" font-size="17.8" font-weight="450" fill="#9aa0ab" text-anchor="start" >unreal, something is wrong</text><g transform="translate(1060 330) rotate(-14)"><rect x="-80" y="-142" width="160" height="284" rx="10" fill="#151821" stroke="#e0a458" stroke-width="2"/><line x1="-80" y1="90" x2="80" y2="90" stroke="#262a35" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M -9.0 -27.0 Q -9.0 -32.4 4.0 -32.4 L 16.0 -32.4 Q 29.0 -32.4 29.0 -27.0 L 30.0 12.0 L 26.1 20.0 L 20.0 90.0 L 12.4 90.0 L 10.0 28.0 L 7.6 90.0 L 0.0 90.0 L -6.1 20.0 L -10.0 12.0 Z" fill="#343a48" stroke-linejoin="round"/><rect x="6.0" y="-44.0" width="8.0" height="14.0" fill="#343a48"/><ellipse cx="10.0" cy="-50.0" rx="8.4" ry="10.4" fill="#343a48"/></g><line x1="990" y1="512" x2="1130" y2="512" stroke="#9aa0ab" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="3 4"/><text x="1060.0" y="540.0" font-family="'Inter Tight','IBM Plex Sans','Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif" font-size="21.1" font-weight="700" fill="#ecebe7" text-anchor="middle" >Dutch tilt</text><text x="1060.0" y="560.0" font-family="'Inter Tight','IBM Plex Sans','Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif" font-size="17.8" font-weight="450" fill="#9aa0ab" text-anchor="middle" >the world is off its level</text></svg>
